FIG. 4B shows, in schematic form, a physical implementation of the mode coupling of FIG. 4A in a photonic system that may be used in some embodiments;
FIG. 5 shows a four-mode coupling scheme that implements a "spreader," or "mode-information erasure," transformation on four modes in accordance with some embodiments;
FIG. 6 illustrates an example optical device that may implement the four-mode mode-spreading transform shown schematically in FIG. 5 in accordance with some embodiments;
FIG. 7 shows a circuit diagram for a dual-rail-encoded Bell state generator that may be used in some embodiments;
